    "message": "Move each person's minute of psychology and its writes to Rust rows\n\nupdate_psychology runs the five built-in models from the entity rows and the\nview, and apply_deltas writes rows, objects and body records. Traced ticks stay\non explain_update. update_long_term reads the previous stress from the rows.\nnative_deltas and native/src/psychology.rs go away.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
